---

quiet: true
skip_list:
  - 'package-latest'
  - 'risky-shell-pipe'
  # The one-file-per-control-family layout puts 66 controls in Cat2/WN10-CC-xxxxxx.yml, 52 in
  # Cat2/WN10-AU-xxxxxx.yml and 30 in Cat2/WN10-00-xxxxxx.yml, and each control is a block of
  # several tasks, so all three exceed the rule's hard-coded 100 tasks (105, 135 and 133). The
  # limit is not configurable: max_tasks is a runtime option that the config-file schema rejects,
  # and there is no CLI flag. Splitting the families further is the only way to satisfy the rule
  # and would break the naming convention shared with the sibling Windows roles.
  # NOTE: this disables the rule repo-wide, so a new file crossing 100 tasks is not reported.
  - 'complexity'
use_default_rules: true
verbosity: 0
